claim.claim-text:
receiving audio recorded by a first computing device, the recorded audio corresponding to a query spoken by a user of the first computing device;
processing the recorded audio to produce a textual representation of the query;
determining, based on the textual representation of the query:
a most relevant search result for the query, the most relevant search result comprising a corresponding telephone number; and
that the query is of a type that is to cause a second computing device of the user to automatically call the corresponding telephone number of the most relevant search result; and
